16963:             <div style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0284c7; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 6px;">
16964:               [NO SLEEP OR NAP RECORDED TODAY — AWAITING WATCH 0xE0 SYNC]
16965:             </div>
16966:             <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #64748b;">
16967:               Daily 24-hour hypnogram (00:01 to 23:59) updates automatically with nocturnal sleep &amp; daytime naps once watch sync completes.
16968:             </div>
16969:           </div>`;
